  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Find $a_n$ for each AP. Then solve $a_n<0$ to find the first negative term.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p10-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$20,17,14,\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a_n=23-3n$; first negative term: $a_8=-1$.",
          "worked": "AP where $a=20$, $d=-3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\a_n&=20+(n-1)(-3)\\\\a_n&=23-3n\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&<0\\\\23-3n&<0\\\\23&<3n\\\\n&>7\\tfrac{2}{3}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe smallest integer index is $8$.\n\n$$a_8=23-3(8)=-1$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$82,79,76,\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a_n=85-3n$; first negative term: $a_{29}=-2$.",
          "worked": "AP where $a=82$, $d=-3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\a_n&=82+(n-1)(-3)\\\\a_n&=85-3n\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&<0\\\\85-3n&<0\\\\85&<3n\\\\n&>28\\tfrac{1}{3}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe smallest integer index is $29$.\n\n$$a_{29}=85-3(29)=-2$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$24\\tfrac{1}{2},24,23\\tfrac{1}{2},\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a_n=\\dfrac{50-n}{2}$; first negative term: $a_{51}=-\\dfrac12$.",
          "worked": "AP where $a=24\\tfrac12$, $d=-\\tfrac12$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\a_n&=24\\tfrac12+(n-1)(-\\tfrac12)\\\\a_n&=\\frac{49}{2}-\\frac12(n-1)\\\\a_n&=\\frac{50-n}{2}\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&<0\\\\\\frac{50-n}{2}&<0\\\\50-n&<0\\\\50&<n\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe smallest integer index is $51$.\n\n$$a_{51}=\\frac{50-51}{2}=-\\frac12$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 77
      }
    ]
